<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;by "ANSI" I assume you mean Windows-1252. &lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To find out a machine's actual "ANSI" encoding, you can use the following:

&lt;c&gt;
use Win32 qw( );

my $ansi_enc = "cp".Win32::GetACP();
&lt;/c&gt;
</doctext>
